# gstack tooling artifacts
.gstack/
export/

# Player settings, rewritten by the game on every settings change. This is
# per-machine state and must never be committed: it is READ AT STARTUP, so a
# committed copy silently reframes every capture the harness takes. The file
# on this machine currently holds fov_idx = 4 (100 deg) against the code's
# FOV_DEFAULT_IDX = 3 (90 deg) - a capture taken here is not the capture a
# clean checkout produces, and before/after comparison is only valid when
# both frames came from the same settings.
engine/crates/jk_tdm/config/settings.txt
